TICVAI | RETAIL BACKEND STRUCTURE
FUNCTIONAL REFERENCE • 58
Retail Board 2 shall use a single Retail Product & Catalog Engine.
TICVAI should not create separate product masters for POS, online, kiosk, mobile or 
individual stores.
The required architecture is:
• Product Master
• ↓
• SKU / Variant
• ↓
• Attributes + Barcode / RFID
• ↓
• Catalog / Assortment
• ↓
• Pricing
• ↓
• Merchandising
• ↓
• Availability
• ↓
• Channel Publication
• ↓
POS / Mobile / Kiosk / B2C / Guest App
This is particularly important for Retail because the same physical SKU may be sold 
simultaneously through several stores and digital channels while drawing from shared or 
different inventory locations. A centralized product model will prevent duplicate SKUs, conflicting
prices, inconsistent descriptions and fragmented reporting.

TICVAI | RETAIL BACKEND STRUCTURE
FUNCTIONAL REFERENCE • 59
TICVAI RETAIL — BOARD 3
Retail POS, Sales, Returns & Fulfilment — Scope of Work
1. Purpose
The Retail POS, Sales, Returns & Fulfilment Board shall provide the complete transactionexecution layer for Retail operations across TICVAI.
The Board shall manage the end-to-end retail transaction lifecycle:
Product Selection Guest Identification Price & Promotion Cart Payment → → → → →
Inventory Commitment Receipt Fulfilment Return / Exchange Financial Posting → → → →
The solution shall support high-volume attraction, entertainment, leisure, event and venue retail
environments, including:
Gift Shops
Merchandise Stores
Souvenir Shops
Retail Kiosks
Mobile Carts

TICVAI | RETAIL BACKEND STRUCTURE
FUNCTIONAL REFERENCE • 60
Pop-Up Stores
Event Merchandise Stores
Photo Shops
Specialty Stores
Mobile POS
Self-Service Kiosks
Click & Collect
B2C / Guest App Orders
The objective is to create one unified Retail Commerce Engine, rather than separate 
transaction logic for each sales channel.
All Retail transactions shall integrate in real time, or through controlled offline synchronization, 
with TICVAI's shared:
Product & Catalog Engine
Pricing Engine
Promotion Engine
Inventory Engine
Payment Engine
Wallet
Loyalty & Membership
Guest Profile
Finance
Approval Engine
Audit Engine
Analytics & AI

