TICVAI RETAIL — BOARD 5
Promotions, Omnichannel Commerce & Guest Engagement — Scope of Work
1. Purpose
The Promotions, Omnichannel Commerce & Guest Engagement Board shall provide the 
centralized commercial orchestration layer for Retail, allowing TICVAI operators to configure 
promotions, campaigns, coupons, vouchers, cross-sell, upsell, omnichannel journeys, guest
targeting and personalized retail experiences across physical and digital sales channels.
The Board shall answer five key commercial questions:
What offer should we provide? To whom? Where? When? Through which channel? → → → →
The architecture shall follow:
Guest / Segment Product / SKU Offer Eligibility Channel Store Inventory → → → → → → →
Transaction Fulfilment Measurement → →
Board 5 shall work across:
Fixed POS
Mobile POS

