• ARCHITECTURAL REQUIREMENT
The most important architectural principle for Board 5 is that TICVAI shall have one centralized 
Promotion & Commerce Rules Engine.
SoftLab should not create:
• POS Promotions
• separately from
• B2C Promotions
• separately from
• Mobile App Promotions
• separately from
• Kiosk Promotions
• separately from
Membership Discounts.
Instead:
• Shared Promotion Engine
• ↓
• Eligibility
• ↓
• Audience
• ↓
• Product / SKU
• ↓
• Price / Benefit
• ↓
• Priority / Stacking

