• ↓
• Store / Channel
• ↓
• Inventory Validation
• ↓
• Transaction Engine
• ↓
• Performance Measurement
This will allow a promotion created once in TICVAI to operate consistently across every permitted
sales channel.
A particularly important TICVAI differentiator should be the connection between Ticketing + 
Guest + Retail + Inventory.
For example:
TICVAI knows that 18,500 guests are attending Saturday's concert, 2,100 are VIP ticket holders, 
historical merchandise conversion is 21%, current event T-shirt stock is insufficient, and VIP 
guests historically spend 38% more on merchandise.
The platform can therefore recommend:
Stock Audience Offer Channel Timing Expected Commercial Result → → → → →
rather than treating Retail as a standalone shop system.

