TICVAI RETAIL — BOARD 6
Retail Intelligence, Analytics, Forecasting & AI Optimization — Scope of Work
1. Purpose
The Retail Intelligence, Analytics, Forecasting & AI Optimization Board shall provide the 
centralized decision-intelligence layer for all TICVAI Retail operations.
Board 6 shall consolidate commercial, operational, inventory, guest, promotion, ticketing, event 
and financial information to provide management with a complete understanding of Retail 
performance and future demand.
The Board shall move beyond traditional dashboards and reporting.
The intelligence cycle shall follow:
Measure Compare Detect Explain Forecast Recommend Simulate Approve → → → → → → →
→ → → Act Measure Outcome Learn
The Board shall answer:
What happened?
Where did it happen?

